        "revision_number": 2,
        "body": "<p>Here's an idiomatic one-liner definition:</p>\n<pre><code>def h: tostring | [while(length&gt;0; .[:-3]) | .[-3:]] | reverse | join(&quot;,&quot;);\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Example</h2>\n<pre><code>12, 123, 1234, 12345678 | h\n</code></pre>\n<h3>Output (using -r option):</h3>\n<pre><code>12\n123\n1,234\n12,345,678\n</code></pre>\n",
