        "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "body": "<p>Here's an idiomatic one-liner definition:</p>\n<pre><code>def h: tostring | [while(length&gt;0; .[:-3]) | .[-3:]] | reverse | join(&quot;,&quot;);\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Example</h2>\n<pre><code>12, 123, 1234, 12345678 | h\n</code></pre>\n<p>###Output (using -r option):</p>\n<pre><code>12\n123\n1,234\n12,345,678\n</code></pre>\n",
        "revision_guid": "5605A350-F4A6-4652-8119-2E0F9FA6F865"
      },
      {
        "user": {
          "account_id": 316835,
          "reputation": 120015,
          "user_id": 997358,
          "user_type": "registered",
          "profile_image": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/f849cfde4e526e22e916fa69103ef7e7?s=256&d=identicon&r=PG",
          "display_name": "peak",
          "link": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/997358/peak"
        },
        "set_community_wiki": false,
        "is_rollback": false,
        "creation_date": 1581408530,
        "post_id": 60164419,
        "post_type": "answer",
        "revision_type": "single_user",
        "revision_number": 1,
        "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "body": "<p>Here's a generic solution for integers or integer-valued strings:</p>\n<pre><code># &quot;h&quot; for &quot;human-readable&quot;\ndef h:\n  def hh: .[0] as $s | .[1] as $answer\n    | if ($s|length) == 0 then $answer\n      else ((if $answer == &quot;&quot; then &quot;&quot; else &quot;,&quot; end) + $answer ) as $a\n      | [$s[0:-3], $s[-3:] + $a] | hh\n      end;\n   [ tostring, &quot;&quot;] | hh;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Example</h2>\n<pre><code>12, 123, 1234, 12345678 | h\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Result (using -r option):</h2>\n<pre><code>12\n123\n1,234\n12,345,678\n</code></pre>\n",
        "revision_guid": "CAEDAB0A-6585-432D-A712-BFBA993ADB2B"
      },
      {
        "user": {
          "account_id": 2550933,
          "reputation": 13399,
          "user_id": 2214695,
          "user_type": "registered",
          "profile_image": "https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/dee2ef257601e05c5659f04de9cb7c67?s=256&d=identicon&r=PG",
          "display_name": "oliv",
          "link": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/2214695/oliv"
